{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:5.115.020","page_type":"section"},"citation":"5.115.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","content_hash":"98bb8705149feb835031d96a8bc6ddd3e80802f3380428ff54652c9fd5b97694","heading":"Transient vendor, peddler, solicitor – License required – Exceptions.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to conduct business as a transient vendor without a license having been issued pursuant to this chapter unless one of the following exceptions applies:\n(1) Sales at wholesale to retail merchants in the usual course of their business.\n(2) Sales conducted inside the following structures: trade centers, convention centers, shopping centers, and trade, exhibition or convention centers located in hotels and motels.\n(3) Garage sales held on premises devoted to residential use.\n(4) Auctions.\n(5) Promotional trade or hobby shows conducted within districts zoned for commercial use.\n(6) Sales or displays at fairs, expositions or promotional events where the activity is sponsored by the City or another governmental entity.\n(7) Sales by a vendor approved by an educational institution, religious organization, civic organization, or not-for-profit organization at athletic events or concessions sponsored by the organization.\n(8) Sales at a farmers’ market that is registered with the Kansas Department of Agriculture.\n(9) Sales of an individual’s personal property by an executor or administrator of the estate.\n(b) It shall be unlawful for any person to conduct business as a peddler or solicitor without a license issued pursuant to this chapter unless the activity is sponsored by an educational institution, religious organization, civic organization or not-for-profit organization. (Ord. 20662 § 4, 6-2-26.)","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"ac04f5e2-e023-59c5-b21f-f131d67fee65"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.115.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","content_hash":"6be8a29442374fb469c00abab20403c7d7b6a076078cb91f83dafd984447ae3c","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","text":"(a) It shall be unlawful for any person to conduct business as a transient vendor without a license having been issued pursuant to this chapter unless one of the following exceptions applies:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"1c2ffdb5-6a62-5ef5-bda4-f3c1171d45aa"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.115.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","content_hash":"4423377dc7c65b7f85d434586d41e2d3c98df14a89bf7f19a7bfb3cccedaf1dc","heading":null,"ordinal":1,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:block:1","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","text":"(1) Sales at wholesale to retail merchants in the usual course of their business.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"131390a3-2861-5f82-bf04-77c6e5a5a4b2"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.115.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","content_hash":"35fbf21340772d8304573577ad8a943a3be42bed8f442120d52b2ea6f2ea304d","heading":null,"ordinal":2,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:block:2","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","text":"(2) Sales conducted inside the following structures: trade centers, convention centers, shopping centers, and trade, exhibition or convention centers located in hotels and motels.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e0451a5d-2874-51eb-b083-418263310ffe"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.115.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","content_hash":"8396fd9ae8fa71b2ef12077ce018054e10f3881815757d5cfb324fbd3c11f739","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","text":"(3) Garage sales held on premises devoted to residential use.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"fddca7c1-74d0-5451-90ca-d1e6c4f87bcd"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.115.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","content_hash":"a6de042e7664f5bd39699db5597e062d979f2cb7e8bdc745f0ae1c9239b24e6c","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","text":"(4) Auctions.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"ef02bfd8-5d42-5189-9596-2a4a31197a4e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.115.020","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.115.020","content_hash":"32900880137da18c44a83289bdc8eecf9afbf944820dc72532d77481864651b9","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:to