gious organization, civic organization or not-for-profit organization. (Ord. 20662 § 4, 6-2-26.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"1053ac94-befe-54c2-a735-097c14a723b5"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.115.020:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}